ing tabletop destination.🎲 Run and grow your own tabletop shop 🧙 Sell collectible figures and complete collections 🛍️ Stock your sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T08:18:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1828894815554509","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"update","title":"PlayTest Patch 0.1.2.18 is Live!","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋 Thanks to all of you who have been playing the playtest and sending us feedback. We really appreciate it. This patch is all about the things you reported, and we think the game feels a lot better now. Here is what we worked on in Patch 0.1.2.18: 🔧 Game Breaking Fixes These were the biggest problems and they are all gone now: Board game tables now wait for all players to sit down before the game starts. No more broken sessions. Fast clicking items at the register no longer causes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-01T11:29:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815554509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1827626365765331","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest Is Now Accessible","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋 We have some really good news! We spent the last few weeks fixing critical bugs and improving core systems. The Tabletop Shop Simulator Playtest is now fully accessible and all features are up and running! 🎮 What Can You Test Right Now? Here's everything you can try: Run your tabletop shop: buy products, stock shelves, serve customers Design your own board games: create unique games and put them on tables for customers to play Hire and manage employees: cashiers, cleaners, restoc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T10:30:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365765331","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1825093633182266","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Sign ups Are Now Open!","summary":"We’re opening a limited playtest for Tabletop Shop Simulator, and we need your feedback!What we’re testing:Core loop and game flowPossible bugs before releasing the DemoOverall game feelYour feedback will directly influence the Early Access version.👉 Click “Request Access” on the store page to join.Spots are limited and we’ll be reviewing feedback actively during this test period.Thank you for helping us improve the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-18T14:14:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633182266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1818752592125002","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #3 – Employees Are Joining the Shop!","summary":"📢 Dev Diary #3 – Employees Are Joining the Shop!Hey everyone!Time for another development update — and this one is a big step toward bringing more life (and chaos) into your tabletop shop!We’ve been working on the employee system, and we’re excited to share the first fully functional behaviors that are now prototyped and being polished.Let’s dive in!👷‍♂️ 🆕 Employees Are Now Working in the ShopYour store is no longer a one-person operation! Employees can now:✔ Stand at the register and handle che","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-11T21:05:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592125002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1817483467036991","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #2 – Crafting Board Games & New Store Mechanics!","summary":"📢 Dev Diary #2 – Crafting Your Own Board Games!Hey everyone!Today we’re excited to give you a sneak peek at one of the big systems we’ve been working on: 🎲 Crafting your own board games inside your shop!This new feature lets you gather components, design gameplay elements, and assemble unique board games that you can use to attract more players and encourage longer play sessions in your store. Players who stay longer will bring more life to your shop — and more income!But that’s not all. Alongsi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-27T15:21:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467036991","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328620-1816849002007242","game_id":"steam-3328620","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Tabletop Shop Simulator! 🎲","summary":"Hey everyone!We’ve been working on Tabletop Shop Simulator for quite some time, and we’re excited to finally share a first look at what we’ve been building! 🎉 In this management-focused shop sim, you’ll run your own tabletop store—arranging shelves, stocking products, hosting play sessions, crafting your own board games, and completing figure collections to unlock unique dioramas and rewards.The game includes over 15 themed figure categories and 100+ collectible figures, covering a wide range of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-19T10:49:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_annou